WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
Look at three foreheads.

2
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.060
One has a U-shaped mark.

3
00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.400
One, three lines of ash.

4
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.340
One, a red mark.

5
00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:12.830
Marks like these can show which
form of God a devotee holds supreme.

6
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.640
For one, it is Vishnu.

7
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.340
For another, Shiva.

8
00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.250
For another, the Goddess.

9
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.380
Three different supremes.

10
00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.490
So is this one religion, or three?

11
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:27.390
In this mission, you'll explore
three great traditions of devotion,

12
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.770
their worship and their ideals.

13
00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:33.730
Then you'll weigh up whether they
are best seen as separate religions.

14
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.370
Your mission: find out whether
Hindus devoted to Vishnu,

15
00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.360
Shiva or the Goddess share one religion.
